UNDER REVIEW — LLM draft fixture (generated by `grepxcel draft`).

This fixture is intentionally EXCLUDED from the parametrized fixture sweeps
(tests/integration/test_drafter_analysis.py and test_csv_pattern_parity.py) while
its pattern is being reviewed/refined. Those sweeps assert curated-reference
quality (analysis ↔ pattern alignment, ≥70% non-empty parity) that a raw draft
does not yet meet.

To promote this into a real reference fixture:
  1. Review/refine pattern.xlsx so extraction is correct.
  2. If the data lives on a non-active sheet, add a --sheet entry to the
     _SHEET_OVERRIDES dicts in both sweep tests.
  3. Delete this UNDER_REVIEW file. The fixture then re-joins the sweeps.
